                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/2757: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-08T15:00:00-05:00">December 8, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>88. Your 135, December 7, 1 p.m. The Department’s No. 83 of December 1 and No. 85
                    of December 4 transmitted to you all the information we have received to
                    date.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
